WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.293
First, launch Copilot CLI.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.111
Type /theme and pick a mode.

00:00:09.111 --> 00:00:10.941
Here we choose dim.

00:00:11.392 --> 00:00:14.603
The color mode is now dim, applied right away.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.120
Like an editor's dark mode switch.
